</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Kurland</surname><given-names>CG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reductive evolution of resident genomes</article-title><source>Trends Microbiol</source><year>1998</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>263</fpage><lpage>268</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9717214</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0966-842X(98)01312-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Moran</surname><given-names>NA</given-names></name><name><surname>Wernegreen</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Lifestyle evolution in symbiotic bacteria: insights from genomics</article-title><source>Trends Ecol Evol</source><year>2000</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>321</fpage><lpage>326</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10884696</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0169-5347(00)01902-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Moran</surname><given-names>NA</given-names></name><name><surname>Mira</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The process of genome shrinkage in the obligate symbiont Buchnera aphidicola</article-title><source>Genome Biol</source><year>2001</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>RESEARCH0054</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11790257</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/gb-2001-2-12-research0054</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zomorodipour</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Andersson</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Obligate intracellular parasites: Rickettsia prowazekii and Chlamydia trachomatis</article-title><source>FEBS Lett</source><year>1999</year><volume>452</volume><fpage>11</fpage><lpage>15</